 "text": "County Services | Jefferson County, MO\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nAccessible Menu\nAnimal Control\nCode Enforcement\nPlanning\nSolid Waste\nSearch\nHome Page\nAgendas & Minutes\nReport Complaints\nCode & Charter\nProperty Viewer\nRecycling Locations\nPopular Links\nFind What You Need\nBuilding Permits\nand Licenses\nPlanning and\nZoning Applications\nSchedule An Inspection\nFAQs\nMaster Plan\nAdopt A Pet\nAbout Us\nThe County Services Department is comprised of four divisions: Planning , Code Enforcement , Solid Waste , and Animal Control . These divisions provide services relating to development services, building permits and inspection, code compliance, recycling, and animal resources and control.\nPlanning Division: Planning, Zoning, Development Review, Development Inspections\nCode Enforcement Division: Building Permits, Building Plan Review, Building Inspections\nSolid Waste Division: Property Maintenance, Zoning Enforcement, Code Enforcement, Solid Waste, Recycling\nAnimal Control Division: Animal Shelter Operations, Animal Adoptions, Animal Welfare Investigations, Licensing and Vaccination Compliance, Stray Animal Pickup, Dangerous Animal Enforcement\nContact Us\nCounty Services\nPhysical Address\n725 Maple Street\nHillsboro , MO 63050\nMailing Address\nP.O. Box 100\nHillsboro , MO 63050\nPhone: 636-797-5310\nDirectory\nCalendar\nSee What’s Happening\nMain County Calendar\nCode Official Tech Bulletin\nMain County Calendar\nOct\n26\nCounty Council Regular Meeting\nCounty Council Regular Meeting Read On\nNov\n4\nParks & Recreation Board\nParks & Recreation Board Read On\nNov\n5\nPublic Safety Commission\nPublic Safety Commission Read On\nNov\n6\nOpioid Settlement Funds Task Force\nOpioid Settlement Funds Task Force Read On\nNov\n9\nCounty Council Regular Meeting\nCounty Council Regular Meeting Read On\nView All Events\n/Calendar.aspx\nCode Official Tech Bulletin\nCode Official Technical Bulletins\nCode Technical Bulletin 2024-01 Backfill around foundations\nCode Technical Bulletin 2024-02 Site Grading 1-29-2024\nContact Us\nPO Box 100\n725 Maple Street\nHillsboro MO 63050\nSocial Media\nFacebook\nLinkedIn\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nQuick Links\nAssessor\nCounty Council\nCounty Services\nPublic Works\nTaxes & Payments\nNewsletters\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nSite Links\nHome\nSite Map\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCopyright Notices\nPrivacy Policy\nEmployees Only\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
